      "text": "Every 30 m window must be classified as asphalt, chipseal, gravel, or dirt.",
      "source_ids": ["m10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label 'cobble' is reserved in the enum but not emitted by any code until cobble data is collected.",
      "source_ids": ["m10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The API contract for the surface classifier must be nailed down before any internals, focusing on signatures, returns, and edge-case behavior.",
      "source_ids": ["m10"]
    }
  ]
}

